{
  "comment": "Hand-crafted from assign_case.json (itself from internal/issue/testdata/graphql/card_3.json, recorded); mutations are never recorded. gh dojo hand-back 3 with assign = true (board.assignee \"@me\") and unassign = \"all\": the card reads the viewer and its assignees with their IDs. Trum-ok, the viewer, stays; octocat is removed in one mutation, after a dry run with --json. The repeat reads the card with Trum-ok alone and writes nothing.",
